    (in the store's order), last in the groups: the default lane group stays
    the first other one. A lane group's list may name an account not marked
    reserved (unreserve up to 1.21 left it there), which was no seat of it;
    with general every listed live account is one, so those entries go and
    the seats stay the same: each one dropped is added to `dropped` as
    (group, email). -> whether the store changed."""
    if has_general(store):
        return False
    accounts = store.get("accounts", [])
    plain = {_email(a) for a in accounts if not a.get("reserved") and _email(a)}
    groups = {}
    for g, emails in (store.get("groups") or {}).items():
