<title>claude-swap</title>
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16'%3E%3Crect x='1' y='6' width='4' height='9' rx='1' fill='%2325a35c'/%3E%3Crect x='6' y='3' width='4' height='12' rx='1' fill='%23e0aa14'/%3E%3Crect x='11' y='1' width='4' height='14' rx='1' fill='%234a35d4'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<style nonce="__NONCE__">
/* claude-swap web. Colours: check's (bars green <50, yellow <80, red >=80),
   the accent marks cl. Type: DIN for the panel's labels and figures, Avenir
